观无破损、脏污等不良；\n2、剪脚正确，金色标识管脚比其他三个管脚腿短。\n\n风险：测试不良品。</p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
